    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cdb99a37b9030829d440019a685a56e0.poster.avif?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cdb99a37b9030829d440019a685a56e0.webm?t=1750345599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cdb99a37b9030829d440019a685a56e0.mp4?t=1750345599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dino Quake is a platformer arcade game where you hit the ground to create quakes, stun enemies, then kick them to trigger epic avalanches. The more enemies you catch, the bigger your avalanche becomes. Explore a prehistoric world with multiple stages, with different paths and replayable runs. Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/17e06484c65893f6f4a665d87ce04a41.webp?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/f5073e443ae542a7abb608309dd73e06.webp?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pure arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 16-bit aesthetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charming music tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/21b1ccd37bd9beb00f964884cbf4cb4d.webp?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=58 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/e32d26125162d486f7bb379298c9a6b8.avif?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=202 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cdb99a37b9030829d440019a685a56e0.poster.avif?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cdb99a37b9030829d440019a685a56e0.webm?t=1750345599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/cdb99a37b9030829d440019a685a56e0.mp4?t=1750345599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dino Quake is a platformer arcade game where you hit the ground to create quakes, stun enemies, then kick them to trigger epic avalanches. The more enemies you catch, the bigger your avalanche becomes. Explore a prehistoric world with multiple stages, with different paths and replayable runs. Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/17e06484c65893f6f4a665d87ce04a41.webp?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/f5073e443ae542a7abb608309dd73e06.webp?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pure arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 16-bit aesthetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charming music tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/21b1ccd37bd9beb00f964884cbf4cb4d.webp?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=58 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342430/extras/e32d26125162d486f7bb379298c9a6b8.avif?t=1750345599\" width=616 height=202 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Join Mina and Kiwi to stop an alien invasion from outer space! Dino Quake is a platformer arcade game where you hit the ground to create quakes, stun enemies, then kick them to trigger epic avalanches. Play solo or team up with a friend in local co-op!",
